# My documentation

This site was created by `lhtml-site init --theme docs`. Edit this file, `src/index.md.j2`,
save it, and the page is rebuilt.

## Where to start

- [Get started](01_start/index.html): install, then write a first page.
- [Guides](02_guides/01_write/index.html): writing, figures, search.
- [Reference](03_reference/01_settings/index.html): the settings of the theme.

## The menu

The menu groups the pages by the `section` of their front matter, and inside a section by
their `group`. The settings of the theme (name, logo, order of the sections...) are the
`docs` keyword of `configure.yaml`: see the [reference](03_reference/01_settings/index.html).
